          </zone>
          <zone h="7229" id="7" type-v2="text" w="96571" x="1714" y="91807">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="true" fontcolor="#193f36" fontsize="13">About the data
</run>
              <run fontcolor="#495d56" fontsize="11">Percentages exclude missing and unclassified land; hover for hectares and data coverage. A change from 30% to 35% is +5 percentage points. Areas may overlap: do not add their hectares.
Source: State of Victoria / DEECA, Victorian Land Cover Time Series (2020), CC BY 4.0. Multi-year maps, not annual measurements. First file: 1985–1990 (catalogue: 1987–1990). Historical cover does not measure habitat health or prove that management worked.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="border-color" value="#000000" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="margin" value="12" />
              <format attr="background-color" value="#eef2ef" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
